  "description": "All street, all day. The Royale frame features progressive geometry throughout the design with premium grade materials and craftsmanship to back them up. A 76-degree headtube angle and 12.5” chainstay length make the Royale frame compact and responsive, ideal for modern day street and plaza riding. 100% 4130 chromoly tubing and both toptube and downtube gussets provide a ton of strength and stiffness. Custom interior chainstay forming provides tire clearance up to 2.55” and the seatstay bridge features a brass badge inlay. This frame comes standard with an integrated seat post clamp, integrated chain tensioners, and removable brake lugs for those looking to install brakes (mount kit sold separately).\n\nSeatstay Bridge\n\nThe Royale frame features a full CNC seatstay bridge with a custom brass badge inlay.\n\nDropout and Tensioners\n\nLaser cut dropouts feature a clean look with integrated chain tensioners to keep your wheel in place.\n\nHeadtube and Gussets\n\nFeaturing full gussets both top and bottom and a 5\" headtube.",
